.     local one2010 "(scatter share sci_reliant_patent [aw=bubble_w] if year == 2010 & secid == `j', msymbol(`sym') mcolor(`col'%55) mlcolor(`col') mlabel(sector) mlabcolor(black) mlabsize(medsmall) mlabposition(3) mlabgap(2))"
{txt}  5{com}. 
